    "androidx.compose.foundation.Indication": "custom indications run per frame on the host. Leave it out: the theme's ripple applies.",
    "androidx.compose.material3.TopAppBarScrollBehavior": "scroll behaviours connect the bar to the host's nested scrolling (Gate B, part b).",
    "androidx.compose.foundation.layout.WindowInsets": "window insets are the host's (Gate B, part b); the default applies.",
    "androidx.compose.ui.unit.IntSize": "sizes are measured on the host, and the end of the host's animation is not reported to the guest yet (Gate B-e). Leave it out."
